msgctxt "quest/051/KinGzd106_05105:TEXT_KINGZD106_05105_SEQ_00:1"
msgid "<ui-color 508><ui-edge-color 509> Quest Sync</ui-edge-color></ui-color><br>This timid lady looks to you imploringly."
msgstr ""

#. ja: フビゴ族の夫を探す
#. de: Den Hoobigo-Ehemann suchen
#. fr: Chercher le mari hoobigo
#. kind: objective
msgctxt "quest/051/KinGzd106_05105:TEXT_KINGZD106_05105_TODO_00:1"
msgid "Search for the despondent man."
msgstr ""

#. ja: チャットの「Say」モードで『太陽のもとへ』と入力し<br>フビゴ族の夫に伝言を伝える
#. de: Im Chat-Modus „Sagen“ dem Ehemann Folgendes mitteilen: „Zur Sonne!“
#. fr: En mode de discussion <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Dire</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, saisir une phrase contenant “cherche le soleil” au mari de la Boonewa discrète, et transmettre son message
#. kind: objective
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
