#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "quest/051/KinGzd106_05105:TEXT_KINGZD106_05105_SYSTEM_000_008:1"
msgid "With the chat mode in <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Say</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, use your keyboard or the software keyboard to enter any phrase containing the words “seek the sun” to stop the despondent man from proceeding any further."
msgstr ""

#. ja: 子どもたちの声が、ずっと俺を呼んでいるんだ。<br>天深きセノーテへ来て、って……！
#. de: Ich höre immerfort die Rufe meiner Kinder. Sie sagen, ich solle zum Himmelstiefen Cenote kommen<nbsp>...
#. fr: Chaque jour, chaque nuit, les cris de leurs âmes en peine résonnent dans ma tête... Ils me demandent de les rejoindre au cénote des Cieux infinis !
#. speaker: HOOBIGOHASBAND05105
msgctxt "quest/051/KinGzd106_05105:TEXT_KINGZD106_05105_HOOBIGOHASBAND05105_000_009:1"
msgid "Wait for me, little ones. Father is coming..."
msgstr ""

#. ja: チャットの会話モードを「Say」モードにして、<br>キーボードやソフトウェアキーボードで『太陽のもとへ』を含む、<br>好きな言葉を入力し、フビゴ族の夫に伝えましょう。
#. de: Gib im Chat-Modus „Sagen“ entweder über die Tastatur oder die virtuelle Tastatur einen beliebigen Satz ein, der „Zur Sonne!“ enthält, um den Hoobigo-Ehemann zur Umkehr zu bewegen.
#. fr: En mode de discussion <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Dire</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, utilisez le clavier ou le clavier virtuel pour saisir une phrase contenant “cherche le soleil” et sortir le mari hoobigo de sa torpeur.
#. speaker: SYSTEM
